        "original_id": "fcb92aaf-da6d-58d4-b7a2-94abb82b01d2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: SPC XL, Microsoft Excel\n- Concepts: statistical analysis, control chart, process capability, histogram, Pareto chart\n- People: Vilfredo Pareto\n\nFacts:\n- SPC XL is an informatic tool and a statistical add-in for Microsoft Excel.\n- SPC XL provides statistical analysis that includes control charts, process capability, histograms, and Pareto charts.\n- A Pareto chart contains both bars and a line graph.\n- In a Pareto chart, individual values are shown in descending order by bars, and the cumulative total is shown by the line.\n- The Pareto chart is named after Vilfredo Pareto.",
